 |===
 ^|Term         ^|Description
+|ACPI           |Advanced Configuration and Power Interface
 |CBQRI          |Capacity and Bandwidth Controller QoS Register Interface
-|RCID           |Resource Control Identifier
+|HMAT           |Hardware Memory Affinity Table
